TITLE Equilibration of 100C solution with mineral assemblage and gas phase at specific partial pressures

SOLUTION 1
    temp      100
    pH        7 charge
    Ca        50 mmol/kgw

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite    0 10
    Gypsum     0 10
    Aragonite  0 10
    CO2(g)     0.0 10
    CH4(g)     log(5) 10
    H2S(g)     log(10) 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file     sim_equilibration2.sel
    -reset    false
    -pH       true
    -temperature true
    -si       Calcite Gypsum Aragonite CO2(g) CH4(g) H2S(g)

END
